# Must be `.idea/*` rather than a bare `.idea`: excluding the directory itself
# stops Git from descending into it, so the negations below can't re-include
# the committed editor config (Prettier/ESLint/code style).
.idea/*
!.idea/prettier.xml
!.idea/jsLinters/
